  "description": "Buggiath – Handwritten Font Duo\nBuggiath is a relaxed and expressive handwritten font duo that combines a flowing script style with a clean sans serif companion. Its natural hand-drawn appearance, smooth strokes, and organic letterforms create a warm, personal, and effortlessly creative aesthetic.\nThe main script font features fluid connections, elegant curves, extended swashes, and expressive letterforms, giving the typeface a casual yet stylish handwritten character. Its slightly imperfect shapes add authenticity and make the font feel genuinely hand-crafted rather than overly polished.\nThe accompanying sans serif provides a simple, bold, and highly readable contrast, making the duo versatile for both decorative headlines and supporting text. Together, the two styles create a balanced combination of personality, warmth, and modern simplicity.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Buggiath – Handwritten Font Duo</p>\n<p>Buggiath is a relaxed and expressive handwritten font duo that combines a flowing script style with a clean sans serif companion. Its natural hand-drawn appearance, smooth strokes, and organic letterforms create a warm, personal, and effortlessly creative aesthetic.</p>\n<p>The main script font features fluid connections, elegant curves, extended swashes, and expressive letterforms, giving the typeface a casual yet stylish handwritten character. Its slightly imperfect shapes add authenticity and make the font feel genuinely hand-crafted rather than overly polished.</p>\n<p>The accompanying sans serif provides a simple, bold, and highly readable contrast, making the duo versatile for both decorative headlines and supporting text. Together, the two styles create a balanced combination of personality, warmth, and modern simplicity.</p>",
